# Bot1 attacks with Llanowar Elves and Bot2 blocks with its Llanowar Elves. After blockers are declared Bot1 casts Diabolic
# Edict, and Bot2 sacrifices its only creature, the blocker. The attacker stays blocked (CR 509.1h, 506.4) although no
# creature blocks it now, so it deals no damage (CR 510.1c): Bot2 stays at 20 life, and Bot1's Elves are unhurt.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Swamp
Llanowar Elves
Diabolic Edict
Island x3
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x5
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Llanowar Elves > Llanowar Elves)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Diabolic Edict.Cast(Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Damage = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Diabolic Edict
